Output: count_star():BIGINT
Aggregate COUNT(*)
  Filter tr_pickup <= "(min(zn_id) + 10)"
    Compute (min(zn_id) + 10)
      Filter tr_pickup >= "min(zn_id)"
        Join ONE-ROW build=right keys=[]
          Scan table=trips source=parquet(files=1, rows=3000) columns=[tr_pickup]
          Aggregate MIN(zn_id)
            Scan table=zones source=parquet(files=1, rows=40) columns=[zn_id]
